---

## Component Responsibilities

| Component | Responsibility | Interface |
|-----------|----------------|-----------|
| **WebSocket Handler** | Accept Twilio Media Streams, convert μ-law 8kHz → PCM 16kHz, route audio | `websockets` + `audioop` |
| **Session Manager** | Track call state, user profile, language, conversation history | Redis hash per `call_sid` |
| **Prisma STT Client** | Maintain persistent WSS to Gnani, stream audio, emit transcripts | Async iterator yielding `TranscriptSegment` |
| **Evon LLM Client** | Format prompt with retrieved schemes, call Evon, parse structured JSON | `httpx` async client |
| **Timbre TTS Client** | Stream text chunks to Gnani, forward audio to Twilio WSS | Async generator yielding `bytes` |
| **Scheme KB Retriever** | Embed user query, search pgvector, return top-K chunks with metadata | `sentence-transformers` + `pgvector` |

