## Data Flow (Recording-Based MVP)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant TestScript as test_mvp.py
    participant Prisma as Prisma STT
    participant Evon as Evon LLM
    participant Timbre as Timbre TTS
    participant KB as Scheme KB

    User->>TestScript: Record audio (Hindi/Hinglish)
    TestScript->>Prisma: POST /transcribe (file)
    Prisma-->>TestScript: Transcript + detected language
    TestScript->>KB: Embed query, retrieve top-K schemes
    KB-->>TestScript: Scheme chunks
    TestScript->>Evon: Prompt + schemes + transcript
    Evon-->>TestScript: Structured eligibility JSON
    TestScript->>Timbre: POST /synthesize (text + lang)
    Timbre-->>TestScript: Audio bytes (WAV/MP3)
    TestScript->>User: Play audio + print transcript
```